<title>USA: U.S. meat output 4.8 pct below week ago-USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 4.8 pct below week ago-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, Feb 1, fell 4.8 pct at 809.2 million lbs.-USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>01-Feb-97	472.1     6.5	326.3     4.3	809.2</p>
<p>25-Jan-97	502.2     7.0	336.8     4.4	850.4</p>
<p>Change:	   -6.0%   -7.1%	-3.1%   -2.3%     -4.8%</p>
<p>03-Feb-96	459.8     6.9	311.2     5.4	783.3</p>
<p>Change:	    2.7%   -5.8%	 4.9%  -20.4%	3.3%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     2198.2    30.5     1444.4    18.9     3692.0</p>
<p>1996 YTD:     2353.7    32.2     1653.0    24.7     4063.6</p>
<p>Change:	   -6.6%   -5.3%     -12.6%  -23.5%     -9.1%</p>
<p>LIVESTOCK SLAUGHTER (HEAD)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING   CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS     HOGS     SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>01-Feb-97     686,000	   32,000     1,731,000	66,000</p>
<p>25-Jan-97     733,000	   35,000     1,796,000	69,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -6.4%	    -8.6%	   -3.6%	 -4.3%</p>
<p>03-Feb-96     650,000	   32,000     1,686,000	77,000</p>
<p>Change:	   5.5%	     0.0%	    2.7%	-14.3%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:   3,220,000	  147,000     7,674,000     290,000</p>
<p>1996 YTD:*  3,313,000	  152,000     8,856,000     382,000</p>
<p>Change:	  -2.8%	    -3.4%	  -13.4%	-24.1%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions  </p>
<p>AVERAGE WEIGHTS (LBS.)</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING  LIVE CATTLE   CALVES/VEALERS   HOGS  SHEEP/LAMBS</p>
<p>01-Feb-97    Est    1166	   333	   257	  132</p>
<p>25-Jan-97    Est    1162	   338	   257	  131</p>
<p>03-Feb-96    Actual 1182	   351	   253	  128</p>
<p>Dressed</p>
<p>01-Feb-97    Est     692	   206	   189	   66</p>
<p>25-Jan-97    Est     689	   204	   188	   65</p>
<p>03-Feb-96    Actual  711	   218	   185	   70</p>
<p>FOR THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL CATTLE SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS ENDING	 STEERS	HEIFERS     COWS     BULLS &amp; STAGS</p>
<p>18-Jan-97     47.8%	 32.3%	18.5%	  1.4%</p>
<p>20-Jan-96     50.2%	 27.8%	20.1%	  1.8%</p>
<p>THE WEEK PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL HOGS SLAUGHTERED BY CLASS</p>
<p>ENDING	BARROWS &amp; GILTS	    SOWS     STAGS &amp; BOARS</p>
<p>18-Jan-97     96.1%			3.3%	   0.6%</p>
<p>20-Jan-96     95.1%			4.1%	   0.8%</p>
<p>*1996 slaughter totals adjusted to reflect NASS revisions.</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 YTD reflects six production days.</p>
<p>1997 YTD reflects four production days</p>
